\pard\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1\par\b\f0\fs22\lang9\tab Rufus 4.15 (2026.06.30)\b0\par\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sl276\slmult1\fs16 Add RISC-V 64 support to UEFI:NTFS\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve the guards for using the "silent" Windows installation option\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve the ability to cancel during write retries\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve progress reporting for compressed image extraction\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix unrestricted XML entity expansion and integer overflow in ezxml parser (courtesy of Eric Sadowski)\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix "silent" Windows installation failing at 75% in most cases\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix a crash during boot when using UEFI:NTFS on Snapdragon X based ARM64 platforms\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix first WUE option always being checked by default\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix an infinite loop when using Windows ISOs that contain multiple WIMs\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix "Enable runtime UEFI media validation" checkbox not always being properly enabled\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Other WUE improvements/fixes for OneDrive removal and username validation (with thanks to @christian8641)\par


